# Public media policy: exhibit HTML/stills stay in Git, video binaries live in R2.
/rotating-memory-index-source/**/*.mp4
/rotating-memory-index-source/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json
/rotating-memory-index-source/ASSET_REPORT.md
/PUBLIC_MEDIA_STAGING/

# Generated build output. The source of truth is static/** plus rotating-memory-index-source/**;
# Netlify rebuilds public/ on every deploy, so the publish directory stays out of Git.
/public/

